OL,3,GNEWSAMan re-arrested over 2005
OL,4,Agrandmother murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been re-arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder more than 20 years after a
OL,8,Fwoman was bludgeoned to death in her
OL,9,Fhome in Doncaster.
OL,11,FNora Tait, 69, was killed on 12 October
OL,12,F2005 after going out for fish and chips
OL,13,Fand her body was discovered by a close
OL,14,Ffriend the next day - but her murderer
OL,15,Fhas never been caught.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said a
OL,18,F57-year-old man had been re-arrested
OL,19,Fand remains in custody. He was
OL,20,Fpreviously arrested in May 2011 before
OL,21,Fbeing released with no further action,
OL,22,Fpolice said.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
