OL,3,GNEWSAMan re-arrested over 2005
OL,4,Agrandmother murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said: "Nora's
OL,7,Ffamily have been informed of this
OL,8,Flatest development and we remain in
OL,9,Fcontact with them as we seek to give
OL,10,Fthem the solace they deserve."
